2.Kurtosis:

-how peaked or flat the distribution is 
-it can be normal peaked ,more peaked,less peaked 
-kurtosis=0--->strong indication -->normal distribution peak(Same peak as normal distribution.)
-kurtosis>0--->more peaked than normal distribution 
-kurtosis<0--->less peaked than normal distribution .

